<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Hippocrates stopped the naproxen and the diphenhydramine after intake. For the first three nights he slept poorly; since then he has slept about six hours with a fixed bedtime, no afternoon wine and a short walk after supper. He takes acetaminophen once or twice a day, and the knee pain on his stairs is 4 of 10. He has had no falls and holds the rail. His vitamin B12 was drawn this morning. He sees Dr. Lindqvist-Bamba of geriatric medicine this afternoon. He asks plainly whether his slower walking is age or something that can be treated. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Knee pain</td><td>4 of 10 on stairs, two weeks off naproxen</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>About six hours without diphenhydramine</td></tr><tr><td>Falls</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Vitamin B12</td><td>418 pg/mL</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

